 334:./src/hardware.c **** //! @brief      enter power down
 335:./src/hardware.c **** //!             we will enter power down by removing conditions forcing the
 336:./src/hardware.c **** //!             power supply to work. You have to remove the external wake-IN
 337:./src/hardware.c **** //!             condition (e.g. terminal 15) too. Otherwise the supply will stay
 338:./src/hardware.c **** //!             active.
